Package: autolearnR
Type: Package
Title: Machine Learning Workflows for Biological Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Luiz", "Garcia",
           email = "luiz.cardoso@ufpr.br",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9616-0927"))
Description: Provides tools for supervised machine learning workflows,
    with a focus on classification tasks in biological datasets.
    Includes dataset diagnostics, classification model training,
    performance evaluation, model comparison, and prediction in
    independent datasets. Supports Logistic Regression, Elastic Net,
    Decision Trees, Random Forest, and Support Vector Machines.
    Designed to promote reproducible model development and evaluation.
